  "body": "This patch release fixes various bugs. Notably, it also fixes the performance issues with shared links. \r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### 🌟 Enhancements\r\n* feat: futo backups 1.16.0 by @nutgood in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33216\r\n### 🐛 Bug fixes\r\n* fix(server): map .hif to image/heif by @nornewman in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33167\r\n* fix(server): queue job status query by @jrasm91 in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33182\r\n* perf(server): shared links cover query by @jrasm91 in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33179\r\n* fix(web): info panel filename alignment by @Snowknight26 in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33175\r\n* fix(web): highlight advanced search filters with camera filters set by @Snowknight26 in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33193\r\n* fix: filename element on detail panel by @danieldietzler in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33199\r\n* fix: prometheus exporter should listen on all interfaces by @danieldietzler in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33203\r\n* fix: workflow step fields default values by @danieldietzler in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33211\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @nornewman made their first contribution in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33167\r\n* @nutgood made their first contribution in https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/33216\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/immich-app/immich/compare/v3.4.0...v3.4.1\r\n",
